  "question": {
    "text": "Alkaline oxidative fusion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> gives \"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> \" which on electrolytic oxidation in alkaline solution produces <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi><mo> </mo></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> respectively are:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>",
